      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that sounds pretty intense. you mentioned the belgian-backed forces suppressed lumumba... can you explain more about why the belgian government and the colonial administration felt it was necessary to intervene like that? i need to understand their reasoning so i can show the full conflict in the film.",
